paranormal activity.

1455
01:44:47,863 --> 01:44:50,164
We are here to answer that call

1456
01:44:50,189 --> 01:44:53,124
because we are the Ghostbusters!

1457
01:44:58,474 --> 01:45:01,410
Well, it's not my
first evil god.

1458
01:45:01,466 --> 01:45:02,808
I am Nadeem.

1459
01:45:02,833 --> 01:45:06,101
